The audit covers technical SEO, content and AI-search visibility. It tells you what is wrong, why it matters and what to fix first. It suits business owners, in-house teams and anyone who wants an independent view of their site or their current agency's work. Implementation is not included in the £495 fee and can be scoped separately.

