## Frequently asked questions

### How is this different from the free SEO diagnosis?

The free diagnosis is a focused 20-minute conversation about one priority problem. The paid audit is a documented investigation with written deliverables you can act on independently.

### Can I share the report with my development team?

Yes. The recommendations spreadsheet is formatted for developer handoff. Each item includes the affected URLs, the issue, the recommended fix and an effort estimate.

### What if I cannot afford to fix everything the audit finds?

Every finding is ranked by revenue impact against effort. You will know which two or three items give the highest return for the lowest effort, and you can start there.

